B.a3s=new A.pf("Why we exist","Paying rent on a bike, week after week, is a trap.","Most riders here work a machine they will never own. They hand over a share of every day's earnings, and at the end of it they have nothing to show for it. We built the Rider Ownership Programme to break that cycle: pay one deposit, clear a short plan, and the asset is yours.",null)
